        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Edwin Brown, Albert Pierrepoint, William Joyce, John Amery\n- Works: Two-Way Stretch, 10 Rillington Place\n- Roles: prison warder, hangman\n\nFacts:\n- In 1960, Edwin Brown played a prison warder in the comedy film \"Two-Way Stretch.\"\n- Albert Pierrepoint executed at least 400 people, including William Joyce, known as \"Lord Haw-Haw,\" and John Amery.\n- In 1971, Edwin Brown played Albert Pierrepoint, the hangman, in the film \"10 Rillington Place.\"",
